      "pinnedBy": null,
      "body": "Yeah the repo seems to be missing `ros-rolling-*` for `resolute`\n\nI think the docs updated before the packages have in this case.\n\nThe package list is here and is missing any of the `ros*desktop*` etc packages http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu/dists/resolute/main/binary-amd64/Packages",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yeah the repo seems to be missing <code class=\"notranslate\">ros-rolling-*</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">resolute</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I think the docs updated before the packages have in this case.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The package list is here and is missing any of the <code class=\"notranslate\">ros*desktop*</code> etc packages <a href=\"http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu/dists/resolute/main/binary-amd64/Packages\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://packages.ros.org/ros2/ubuntu/dists/resolute/main/binary-amd64/Packages</a></p>",
